From 836183d1487bd2a70d0f901c7714ee9d8cb83dbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghajarvpn Build <build@ghajarvpn.local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:39:26 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(android): full-bleed welcome overlay, vpn state gate,
 multi-source channels

- welcome: screen always fully covered (crop backdrop + Fit original), hairline
  frame, no enter button and no educational panel, auto-close and tap dismiss
- vpn state: debounce rapid connect/disconnect, drop stale lookup results via
  lookup generation, clear IP/country/flag on disconnect
- channels: multi-source free-config scraping through shared extraction rules
- npvt: open-text payloads import through the shared rules; locked payloads
  still require the owner key and are never bypassed
- tests: welcome overlay rules, channel rules, vpn state gate; Android 14
  welcome regression updated for the button-less overlay
